('FC-1', 'Rest in Grace Church', 'nondenominational', NULL, NULL, NULL, '28200 Bouquet Canyon Rd, Unit A, Santa Clarita, CA 91350', '(661) 360-9799', 'https://www.rigchurch.org/', 'restingracechurch@gmail.com', NULL, 'Sundays — see rigchurch.org for current service times', 'A non-denominational church in Santa Clarita focused on creating a place for God and His people to rest together. Offers a live Sunday service, kids ministry, nursery, and online livestreaming for those who can’t attend in person.', NULL, NULL, TRUE, 'Benjamin', NULL),
